[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_EFFICIENCY]
Kirins Dividend

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_EFFICIENCY_desc]
Kirins are hardworking and intelligent creatures, numerous in number, willing to accept low wages and capable of performing high-efficiency work. With their efforts, the industrialization process of the community is bound to be successful.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_EFFICIENCY]
麒麟红利

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_EFFICIENCY_desc]
麒麟们都是勤劳而聪明的生物，他们数量众多，愿意接受低廉的薪水，并有能力从事高效的工作，在麒麟们的努力下，社群的工业化进程必然能迅速取得成功。

